#section[Professional Summary]

*Full Stack Engineer* with *6 years of experience* building scalable, high-performance web applications. Strong expertise in *React*, *Next.js*, and *frontend architecture*, complemented by hands-on experience with *NestJS*, *microservices*, *PostgreSQL*, *MongoDB*, and *Redis*. Experienced in *application performance optimization*, *secure application development*, and delivering *end-to-end features* across frontend and backend systems.


